  "properties": {
    "title": "Gleo Feature Frenzy",
    "description": "Gleo is a nascent javascript WebGL mapping library. It aims to find a niche alongside Leaflet, OpenLayers, MapLibre and Deck.gl.\r\n\r\nThis library was presented at FOSS4G 2022. This will be a presentation of the features developed during the last year, including live examples, clustering, colour spaces, and vector field handling.",
